    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "We as a group wanted to come up with a way where your happiness and comfort ability would not change from your house to your car and insure comfort on the road to insure safe driving.  Some of the questions we addressed were how the driver or passenger would want his environment to be in certain situations.  If the driver was upset or in a bad mood, he would not want to come into his car and hear music that would upset him.  Likewise, if the driver was happy, it would be recognized and happy music will then be played.  Or for another example, if the driver was excepting company in his car as like he would a guest in his living room; the car would need to be able to change settings for different groups of people like of a boss or a group of friends.  We wanted to create something that allows the driver to customize the inside atmosphere of the car exactly how they want it.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
